  "keyFeatures": [
    "PHP 8 attribute-driven dependency injection with #[Service], #[Autowired], #[Bean]",
    "Aspect-oriented programming for cross-cutting concerns (caching, transactions, retries)",
    "REST API routing via Swoole HTTP server with #[RestController] and #[RequestMapping]",
    "Async background tasks with #[Async] and cron-style scheduling with #[Scheduled]",
    "Declarative transaction management with #[Transactional]",
    "Built-in Prometheus metrics via Actuator",
    "Extensible module system (Redis, Kafka, Doctrine ORM, SQS, S3, OpenSearch, Consul, Eureka)",
    "Spring Boot-compatible programming model for teams migrating from Java"
  ],
